        "url": "https://video.blender.org/video-playlists/b32fc690-7c37-4d20-a16c-f985f60de007",
        "displayName": "Project Gold",
        "description": "A “story from the heart”, this metaphorical journey into the depths of human experience explores the fragility of life and our capacity for resilience and inner transformation.\r\n\r\nThe goals of the project are to push Blender in the production of 2D/3D animation, ambitious effects and stylised rendering workflows - using the ongoing developments on Geometry Nodes, Grease Pencil and Cycles. ",
